      "en": "For Mordecai was great in the king’s house, and his fame went out throughout all the provinces, for the man Mordecai grew greater and greater.",
      "ko": "모르드개가 왕궁에서 존귀하여 점점 창대하매 이 사람 모르드개의 명성이 각 도에 퍼지더라",
      "source_text_hash": "2aea3a4ea0dead3a560b12a9b1292829bacbe7441314170c7ccd348f039f91b4",
      "translation_text_hash": "08de1599d3015d98c0997d597b06faa29b2cbce8e98886a157edfbce45e615ec",
