      "en": "The Jews struck all their enemies with the stroke of the sword, and with slaughter and destruction, and did what they wanted to those who hated them.",
      "ko": "유다인이 칼로 그 모든 대적을 쳐서 도륙하고 진멸하고 자기를 미워하는 자에게 마음대로 행하고",
      "source_text_hash": "91a0f20bfdaf71eb41094db871217fa0092e3184529f13606961903b4aa35065",
      "translation_text_hash": "0ba8089cd7a957c1def25ef399ced184d353455e33a69b4f2cb2f89e0c6fb433",
