        {
          "book": "EST",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "On that day, the number of those who were slain in the citadel of Susa was brought before the king.",
      "ko": "그 날에 도성 수산에서 도륙한 자의 수효를 왕께 고하니",
      "source_text_hash": "6067143a7324b8ed4662ccf9bd15c219c4c4607a21614e1a863f3a1386a1e3f6",
      "translation_text_hash": "7e6a683e7405cf9b13fa08f199b6c44bb9c7a7ed57aeaf00cd83c93dfaeb268b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
