      "en": "because Haman the son of Hammedatha, the Agagite, the enemy of all the Jews, had plotted against the Jews to destroy them, and had cast “Pur”, that is the lot, to consume them and to destroy them;",
      "ko": "곧 아각 사람 함므다다의 아들 모든 유다인의 대적 하만이 유다인을 진멸하기를 꾀하고 부르 곧 제비를 뽑아 저희를 죽이고 멸하려 하였으나",
      "source_text_hash": "c3c5ae42e327c9724bdcbdbaef241b29ecff295d8f839851c8c25e0081972a19",
      "translation_text_hash": "047ef77edbbf45bbb2a94c5b77ccc59bb0f16a7715ad78dc61329c99ebf94312",
